---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { languages, type Lang } from '../../../../data/profile';
import { lumabough } from '../../../../data/lumabough';
import { chapters, demoEvents, comparisons, findings } from '../../../../data/lumabough-details';
export function getStaticPaths() { return languages.map(lang => ({ params: { lang } })); }
const lang=Astro.params.lang as Lang; const zh=lang==='zh';
---
<Layout lang={lang} title="LumaBough · 光枝" description={lumabough.summary[lang]} path="projects/lumabough/">
<section class="wrap project-intro"><a class="back-link" href={'/'+lang+'/projects/'}>← {zh ? '全部作品' : 'All projects'}</a><div class="project-title lumabough-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / RENDERING ENGINEERING</p><h1>LumaBough<span class="title-period">.</span></h1></div><span class="badge">MIT · {lumabough.tag}</span></div><div class="project-description"><h2>{zh ? '光枝：从帧构建到资源生命周期' : 'From frame construction to resource lifetimes'}</h2><p class="lede">{lumabough.summary[lang]}</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="#demo">{zh ? '观看双后端演示' : 'Watch both backends'} ↓</a><a class="button button-outline" href={lumabough.repo}>GitHub ↗</a><a class="button button-outline" href={lumabough.release}>{zh ? '预览版与下载' : 'Preview & downloads'} ↗</a></div><p class="video-note">{zh ? 'MiniEngine 的独立公开作品库；展示名称为 LumaBough，内部命名与程序名保留 MiniEngine。项目借助 Agent 推进实现、验证与文档整理，本页不将协作产出表述为纯手工独立实现。' : 'The independent public portfolio repository for MiniEngine. LumaBough is the public name; internal names and executables retain MiniEngine. Agents assisted implementation, verification, and documentation; collaborative output is not presented as entirely manual solo work.'}</p></section>
<section class="wrap project-facts" aria-label={zh ? '项目概况' : 'Project overview'}><div><span class="eyebrow">PLATFORM</span><strong>Windows x64 / C++20</strong></div><div><span class="eyebrow">BACKENDS</span><strong>D3D11 / D3D12</strong></div><div><span class="eyebrow">ARCHITECTURE</span><strong>RenderPacket / Render Graph</strong></div><div><span class="eyebrow">DELIVERY</span><strong>{zh ? '源码 · 演示 · 证据' : 'Source · Demos · Evidence'}</strong></div></section>
<nav class="wrap lumabough-nav" aria-label={zh ? '本页内容' : 'On this page'}><a href="#question">01 / {zh ? '技术问题' : 'Questions'}</a><a href="#engineering">02 / {zh ? '架构与实现' : 'Architecture'}</a><a href="#demo">03 / {zh ? '演示解读' : 'Demo guide'}</a><a href="#evidence">04 / {zh ? '实验与验证' : 'Results'}</a><a href="#download">05 / {zh ? '运行与来源' : 'Run & sources'}</a></nav>
<section class="wrap section lumabough-reading" id="question"><p class="eyebrow">01 / QUESTIONS</p><h2>{zh ? '一帧能画出来之后，还要回答什么？' : 'Once a frame renders, what remains to solve?'}</h2><p class="lede">{zh ? '这个项目关注的不只是画面，而是双后端下可表达、可追踪、可验证的渲染过程。三个核心问题分别涉及 API 边界、执行顺序和资源所有权。' : 'The project goes beyond the image to a rendering process that can be expressed, traced, and verified across two backends. Its three core questions concern API boundaries, execution order, and resource ownership.'}</p><ol class="lumabough-questions"><li>{zh ? 'D3D11 / D3D12 的行为不同，哪些语义能共享，哪些必须留在后端？' : 'Which semantics can D3D11 and D3D12 share, and which belong inside their backends?'}</li><li>{zh ? '怎样并行准备 packet，同时保持稳定的排序、资源访问与提交语义？' : 'How can packet preparation run in parallel while preserving stable ordering, resource access, and submission semantics?'}</li><li>{zh ? '新 revision 到来时，如何保留旧 Ready，并在 GPU 真正完成后释放资源？' : 'When a new revision arrives, how can the old Ready state survive until replacement and GPU resources remain alive until completion?'}</li></ol></section>
<section class="wrap section lumabough-reading" id="engineering"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / ARCHITECTURE & IMPLEMENTATION</p><h2>{zh ? '从模块边界，走到一帧和一次资产请求。' : 'From module boundaries to frames and asset requests.'}</h2></div></div><p>{zh ? '以下三张图是公开版本的静态架构说明，点击可查看原始 SVG；它们解释实现职责，不代替运行测试或性能证据。' : 'These three figures are static architecture descriptions from the public version. Open each original SVG for detail. They explain implementation responsibilities rather than replacing runtime tests or performance evidence.'}</p>{chapters.map((chapter,index)=><article class="lumabough-chapter" id={'architecture-'+chapter.file}><p class="eyebrow">0{index+1} / {chapter.file.toUpperCase()}</p><h3>{chapter.title[lang]}</h3><p>{chapter.question[lang]}</p><h4>{zh ? '实现机制' : 'Implementation'}</h4><p>{chapter.implementation[lang]}</p><div class="limit-note"><strong>{zh ? '设计取舍' : 'Tradeoffs'}</strong><p>{chapter.tradeoff[lang]}</p></div><figure class="evidence-figure"><a href={'/media/lumabough/'+chapter.file+'.svg'} aria-label={chapter.title[lang]+(zh ? '，查看原图' : ', open original')}><img src={'/media/lumabough/'+chapter.file+'.svg'} width="1200" height="560" alt={chapter.title[lang]} loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption><h4>{zh ? '图' : 'Figure'} {index+1} · {chapter.title[lang]}</h4><dl class="figure-reading"><div><dt>{zh ? '如何读图' : 'How to read it'}</dt><dd>{chapter.reading[lang]}</dd></div><div><dt>{zh ? '解释边界' : 'Interpretation limits'}</dt><dd>{chapter.boundary[lang]}</dd></div></dl><p class="figure-source"><a href={lumabough.source+'docs/architecture/'+chapter.file+'.svg'}>{zh ? '固定版本原图' : 'Pinned source figure'}</a> · <a href={lumabough.source+'docs/architecture/DECISIONS.md'}>{zh ? '架构决策' : 'Architecture decisions'}</a></p></figcaption></figure></article>)}</section>
<section class="wrap section" id="demo"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / DYNAMIC DEMOS</p><h2>{zh ? '两个后端，同一组边界事件。' : 'Two backends. The same boundary events.'}</h2></div></div><p class="lede">{zh ? '两个独立进程分别展示尺寸变化、零尺寸暂停与恢复，以及 shader 候选接受或拒绝后继续渲染。视频使用固定场景与事件字幕，关注状态变化而非复杂场景效果。' : 'Separate processes demonstrate resizing, zero-size suspension and restoration, and continued rendering after shader candidate acceptance or rejection. A fixed scene and event captions make state changes the focus.'}</p><div class="lumabough-demos">{['d3d11','d3d12'].map(backend=><article><h3>{backend.toUpperCase()}</h3><div class="video-frame"><video controls playsinline preload="none" width="1920" height="1080" poster="/media/lumabough/render-preview.png" aria-label={backend.toUpperCase()+(zh ? ' 动态演示' : ' dynamic demonstration')} aria-describedby="demo-note"><source src={'/media/lumabough/lumabough-demo-'+backend+'.mp4'} type="video/mp4" /><a href={'/media/lumabough/lumabough-demo-'+backend+'.mp4'}>{zh ? '打开视频' : 'Open video'}</a></video></div></article>)}</div><p class="video-note" id="demo-note">{zh ? '视频按帧与事件推进，来自公开 Release，保持原文件字节。演示的是程序化 RHI 事件，不是 OS 最小化、文件监听热更新、自由相机或实时性能测量；两个后端分别运行，不是进程内切换。封面是较早的固定场景预览，并非视频抽帧。' : 'The frame- and event-driven demos are mirrored byte-for-byte from the public Release. They show programmatic RHI events, not OS minimization, file-watcher hot reload, a free camera, or real-time performance measurement. Backends run separately, not via an in-process switch. The poster is an earlier fixed-scene preview, not a video frame.'}</p></section>
<section class="wrap section lumabough-reading" aria-label={zh ? '演示事件阅读指南' : 'Demo event guide'}><h3>{zh ? '按事件阅读，而不是按静态画面猜测。' : 'Read the events, not just the static image.'}</h3><p>{zh ? '两个视频独立录制，事件时刻与总时长不应直接对齐。以下按共同的逻辑顺序说明动作、预期结果和不能据此推断的内容。' : 'The videos were recorded independently; their timestamps and durations should not be aligned as if synchronized. The following common logical sequence explains each action, expectation, and limit.'}</p><div class="case-results-table" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label={zh ? '演示事件表，可横向滚动' : 'Demo event table, horizontally scrollable'}><table class="lb-prose-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">{zh ? '事件' : 'Event'}</th><th scope="col">{zh ? '发生什么' : 'What happens'}</th><th scope="col">{zh ? '如何理解' : 'Interpretation'}</th></tr></thead><tbody>{demoEvents.map(row=><tr>{row.map((cell,index)=>index===0?<th scope="row">{cell[lang]}</th>:<td>{cell[lang]}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="evidence"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / RESULTS & LIMITS</p><h2>{zh ? '可复核，也保留未获支持的结论。' : 'Reviewable results, including unsupported gains.'}</h2></div></div><div class="lumabough-reading"><h3>{zh ? '先看协议，再看四项比较' : 'Read the protocol before the four comparisons'}</h3><p>{zh ? '有效组 lb-current-004 在单机 D3D12、1920×1080、VSync off 下完成；5 种配置各 5 次独立运行，按五轮完整区组执行，每次预热 120 帧、测量 600 帧。packet 负载为 50,000 代理（并行 w8/c256），streaming 为 500 代理。25 次运行的前台比例均为 1.0，GPU 有效查询均为 597/600，validationMessages=0。' : 'Valid group lb-current-004 ran on one machine using D3D12, 1920×1080, and VSync off. Five configurations each had five independent runs in five complete blocks, with 120 warmup and 600 measured frames per run. Packet workloads use 50,000 agents (parallel w8/c256); streaming uses 500. All 25 runs report foreground ratio 1.0, 597/600 valid GPU queries, and zero validation messages.'}</p><p>{zh ? '主指标是每次运行 cpuFrameMs 的中位数，再取五次运行中位数的中位数。下表单位为 ms，变化为候选相对基线；负值表示数值下降，不自动等于通过。噪声阈值按预注册的 max(3%, 2×基线相对 MAD) 判定，漂移与受保护指标需一起检查。' : 'The primary metric is the median of five per-run cpuFrameMs medians. Values below are milliseconds; change is candidate relative to baseline. A negative value is a numerical reduction, not automatic acceptance. The preregistered noise rule uses max(3%, 2×baseline relative MAD), with drift and protected metrics checked separately.'}</p><div class="case-results-table" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label={zh ? '性能比较表，可横向滚动' : 'Performance table, horizontally scrollable'}><table><caption>{zh ? 'lb-current-004 · 25 次有效运行 · 无 ACCEPTED' : 'lb-current-004 · 25 valid runs · No ACCEPTED outcome'}</caption><thead><tr>{(zh?['比较','基线（ms）','候选（ms）','变化','判定']:['Comparison','Baseline (ms)','Candidate (ms)','Change','Verdict']).map(label=><th scope="col">{label}</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody>{comparisons.map(row=><tr>{row.map((cell,index)=>index===0?<th scope="row">{cell}</th>:<td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div>{findings.map(finding=><div class="case-explanation"><h3>{finding.title[lang]}</h3><p>{finding.text[lang]}</p></div>)}<p class="figure-source"><a href={lumabough.source+'docs/evidence/NEW-PERFORMANCE.md'}>{zh ? '当前实验报告与失败尝试' : 'Current experiment and failed attempts'}</a> · <a href={lumabough.source+'docs/evidence/PERFORMANCE-EVIDENCE-PACK.md'}>{zh ? '公开逐帧数据与复算说明' : 'Public per-frame data and recomputation'}</a></p><h3>{zh ? '运行验证与性能收益分开判断' : 'Separate runtime validation from performance gains'}</h3><p>{zh ? '上游 v8 记录第二台机器的双后端 1202 帧运行、Demo 事件路径、换目录启动与负例检查。同协议、同 extent 下 graphHash / commandHash / visibleSequenceHash 跨机一致；像素哈希不同不应被改写为跨 GPU 逐位一致。Demo 事件验证运行中，动作前 anchor 与末帧逐字节相等，用于核对恢复后的画面。真实读者走查仍延期。' : 'Upstream v8 records dual-backend 1,202-frame runs, demo event paths, launching from a different working directory, and negative checks on a second machine. With matching protocol and extent, graphHash, commandHash, and visibleSequenceHash agree across machines; differing pixel hashes must not be rewritten as bit-identical output across GPUs. In the demo event-validation runs, byte-identical pre-change anchor and final images check restoration. Reader walkthroughs remain deferred.'}</p></div>
<div class="lumabough-topics"><article><h3>{zh ? '运行包验证' : 'Runtime package validation'}</h3><p>{zh ? '预览运行包面向 Windows 10/11 x64 的 m4-visual-baseline 场景，包含 D3D11 与 D3D12。上游记录了第二台机器独立运行；真实读者走查延期，不能由“运行通过”推定易用性。' : 'The preview runtime supports m4-visual-baseline on Windows 10/11 x64 with D3D11 and D3D12. Upstream records independent execution on a second machine. Reader walkthroughs were deferred; successful execution does not establish usability.'}</p><a class="text-link" href={lumabough.source+'docs/evidence/CANDIDATE-REVIEW.md'}>{zh ? '运行范围与候选验证' : 'Runtime scope and candidate review'} ↗</a></article><article><h3>{zh ? '性能实验：不宣称当前加速' : 'Performance: no current speedup claim'}</h3><p>{zh ? 'lb-current-004：单机 D3D12、关闭 VSync，5 种配置各 5 次运行，每次 600 个测量帧。四项比较为 1 INCONCLUSIVE + 3 REJECTED，无 ACCEPTED。公开证据包可复算，但不代表预览运行包 v8 的性能；历史加速声明的源码身份缺口仍保留。' : 'lb-current-004: one machine, D3D12, VSync off, five configurations with five runs each and 600 measured frames per run. Four comparisons yielded 1 INCONCLUSIVE and 3 REJECTED, with no ACCEPTED result. Public data supports recomputation, but does not measure the v8 runtime package; historical speedup claims retain their source-identity gap.'}</p><a class="text-link" href={lumabough.source+'docs/evidence/PERFORMANCE-EVIDENCE-PACK.md'}>{zh ? '协议、数据与结论' : 'Protocol, data and conclusions'} ↗</a></article></div><p class="video-note">{zh ? '范围：Vulkan 未实施；设备丢失不承诺自动恢复；glTF 导入是受限子集。不是完整编辑器或通用商业引擎，瞬态池内存稳定也不等于进程零泄漏。本站未重新运行引擎或性能实验。' : 'Scope: Vulkan is not implemented; device-loss recovery is not guaranteed; glTF import supports a limited subset. This is not a full editor or general-purpose commercial engine, and stable transient-pool memory does not mean a leak-free process. This website has not rerun the engine or its experiments.'}</p></section>
<section class="wrap section lumabough-reading"><h3>{zh ? '如何体验与核验' : 'How to try and verify it'}</h3><ol class="lumabough-questions"><li>{zh ? '在固定 Release 下载 lumabough-5d320c7-v8.zip，并用 SHA256SUMS-external.txt 校验；解压后按包内 RUN.md 分别运行 D3D11 / D3D12。运行包不要求 Visual Studio、SDK、DXC 或 Python。' : 'Download lumabough-5d320c7-v8.zip from the pinned Release and verify it against SHA256SUMS-external.txt. Extract it and follow RUN.md for D3D11 and D3D12. The runtime does not require Visual Studio, the SDK, DXC, or Python.'}</li><li>{zh ? '性能复算使用独立的 lumabough-performance-evidence-v1.zip，包含去标识逐帧数据与 Python 分析器。复算已有样本不等于重新运行引擎 benchmark。' : 'Performance recomputation uses the separate lumabough-performance-evidence-v1.zip, containing de-identified per-frame data and a Python analyzer. Recomputing existing samples is not rerunning the engine benchmark.'}</li><li>{zh ? '需要修改或构建源码时，按固定版本开发指南准备工具链；运行 ZIP 的支持范围不覆盖 m7-* 性能场景、Tracy 或 Capture 工具链。' : 'To modify or build source, use the pinned development guide for toolchain setup. The runtime ZIP does not include m7-* performance scenarios, Tracy, or the Capture toolchain.'}</li></ol><div class="limit-note"><strong>{zh ? '三个身份不要混用' : 'Keep three identities separate'}</strong><p>{zh ? '页面资料：v0.1.0-preview（f26b8b9）；预览运行包：构建提交 5d320c7；性能结论：lb-current-004 的冻结源码/EXE。历史 MiniEngine 声明另有来源身份缺口，不能通过当前仓库公开自动补齐。' : 'Page sources: v0.1.0-preview (f26b8b9). Preview runtime: build commit 5d320c7. Performance results: the frozen source/EXE of lb-current-004. Historical MiniEngine claims retain separate source-identity gaps; publishing this repository does not resolve them.'}</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap contact-section" id="download"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / RUN & SOURCES</p><h2>{zh ? '继续阅读源码与设计。' : 'Explore the source and design.'}</h2><p>{zh ? '页面资料固定于 v0.1.0-preview；该 tag 与运行包的构建提交分别记录。项目自有代码为 MIT；演示环境使用 Rob Tuytel / Poly Haven 的 Qwantani（CC0），第三方素材保留各自许可。' : 'Sources are pinned to v0.1.0-preview; the tag and runtime build commit are tracked separately. Project-owned code is MIT; the demo environment uses Qwantani by Rob Tuytel / Poly Haven (CC0). Third-party assets retain their own licenses.'}</p><p><a href={lumabough.source+'assets/LICENSES.md'}>{zh ? '素材署名与许可' : 'Asset attribution and licenses'}</a> · <a href={lumabough.source+'docs/evidence/README.md'}>{zh ? '证据索引' : 'Evidence index'}</a></p></div><a class="text-link" href={lumabough.release}>{zh ? '下载公开预览版' : 'Download the public preview'} ↗</a></section>
</Layout>
